|---|---|---|---|
| goal-plan (pick, say why, steps, helpers and resources, check, look back) | Health, grades K to 2, carried through grades 3 to 5 (grade 5 unit 15) | Unit 1 (g6-phw-strengths-and-wellness: what a strength adds to a goal) | Unit 8 (g6-phw-assess-health-set-goal, g6-phw-goal-alone-or-with, g6-pa-habits-supports-barriers), unit 17 (g7-phw-write-goal-link, g7-phw-plan-supports-barriers), unit 26 (g8-phw-habits-personal-community, g8-phw-goal-monitor, g8-phw-goal-effect); on to grade 9 |
