NHES.S3.2.2	Students show when and how to ask for help from people at home, school or in the community.
NHES.S3.2.3	Students find the people who help with health at school and nearby.
NHES.S3.5.1	Students choose which adults, people and health resources suit different situations.
NHES.S3.5.2	Students find wellness resources at home, at school and in the community.
NHES.S3.5.3	Students judge whether health facts, products and services are correct and can be trusted.
NHES.S3.5.4	Students describe how wrong or misleading health claims can hurt people.

