{"strand": "meh", "grade": "8", "skill_id": "g8-meh-suicide-help", "standard": "~NHES.S4.8.10; ~NHES.S4.8.7", "assumes": "g7-meh-self-harm-help", "hands_on": "g9-meh-suicide-and-self-harm-help", "model_in": "help-steps", "model_out": "help-steps", "words": "crisis; 988; warning sign; trusted adult", "cross_subject": "", "notes": "Sensitive unit (removable). Leave-out note and family note before it as STANDARD.md section 5 says; the disclosure steps are on the approach page. The course still meets these skills in g8-meh-express-concern and g8-meh-teamwork. Teacher note: no method detail, a help line and an adult plan are on the first page, safe-messaging rules, counselor on call. Warning signs, what to say to a friend, who to tell right away, and where help is. Serves HECAT.MEH.HBO6, HECAT.V.HBO10."}
{"strand": "sh", "grade": "8", "skill_id": "g8-sh-prevention-and-health", "standard": "~NHES.S4.8.8; ~NHES.S4.8.9", "assumes": "g7-sh-relationships-consent", "hands_on": "g9-sh-health-and-consent", "model_in": "boundary-steps; help-steps", "model_out": "boundary-steps; help-steps", "words": "pregnancy; infection; contraception; testing", "cross_subject": "", "notes": "Sensitive unit (removable). Leave-out note and family note before it as STANDARD.md section 5 says; the disclosure steps are on the approach page. The course still meets these skills in g8-v-negotiate-compromise and g8-meh-different-views. Teacher note: school or family decides; medically accurate, inclusive, no shame. How pregnancy happens and ways to prevent it, how infections spread and are prevented, testing and where health services are, and how to help a friend get accurate information. Serves HECAT.SH.HBO5, HECAT.SH.HBO6, HECAT.SH.HBO7, HECAT.SH.HBO8, HECAT.SH.HBO10."}

